  "content": "<p>情緒化亮度還是不夠暗嗎？想要無月之夜和沒有照明的洞穴變得漆黑一片嗎？這個模組正適合你！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/I6YI5qJIQU0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/7NaqR2e\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/7NaqR2e</a></p><p>從 Minecraft 1.17 版本開始支援 Forge</p><p>還有針對 1.16 版本的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/total-darkness\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge 移植版</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>快速摘要</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>滿月 = 正常的 Minecraft 亮度</li>\n<li>新月 = 完全無光</li>\n<li>無火炬光且無天空光 = 純粹黑暗，不受月相影響</li>\n<li>支援 Fabric Mod Loader</li>\n<li>僅限用戶端</li>\n<li>無需依賴其他模組</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>設定</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>設定存放於 <span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">config/darkness.properties</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">dark_overworld</span>：在主世界啟用（預設：<span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">true</span>）</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">dark_default</span>：在類似主世界、擁有天空的模組維度中啟用（預設：<span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">true</span>）</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">dark_nether</span>：在地獄啟用（預設：<span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">true</span>）</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">dark_end</span>：在終界啟用（預設：<span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">true</span>）</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">dark_skyless</span>：在無天空的模組維度中啟用，如終界和地獄（預設：<span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">true</span>）</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">dark_nether_fog</span>：設定值介於 0.0 至 1.0（含）之間，可使地獄迷霧更暗（預設：<span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">0.5</span>）</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">dark_end_fog</span>：設定值介於 0.0 至 1.0（含）之間，可使終界迷霧更暗（預設：<span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">0.0</span>）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>未使用模組</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/260/736/310/172/without-darkness.png\" alt=\"未使用\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>使用模組後</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/260/735/310/172/with-darkness.png\" alt=\"使用後\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>歡迎在模組包中使用本模組。</p>",
